{"n": 461, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "461.webp", "text": "26-8\n\n26 11 051 REPLACING JOINT DISC FOR\nPROPELLER SHAFT (REAR)\n~ Four Whee! Drive —\n\nRemove exhaust assembly - see\n18 00 020.\nUnscrew heat shield.\n\nLoosen threaded sleeve several turns\nwith Special Tool 26 1 060 or 26 1 040.\n\nInstallation:\n\nTighten threaded sleeve with Special\nTool 26 1 060 or 26 1 040 after finish-\ning installation.\n\nTightening torque’.\n\nUnscrew propeller shaft on transfer\nbox.\n\nInstallation\nReplace stop nuts.\nTightening torque’.\n\nImportant!\n\nOnly turn nuts or bolts on flange end\nwhenever possible by design to avoid\nStrain in joint disc.\n\n* See Specifications\n\nPush propeller shaft together and pull\nout of center on transfer box.\n\nNote!\n\nPropeller shaft was balanced as an as-\nsembly and must only be replaced as\nsuch.\n\nVersion without Slide:\n\nBolts (1 ... 3) must be loosened to re-\nmove propeller shaft from gearbox.\nJoint disc remains on gearbox.\n\ninstallation:\nTightening torque*.\n\nPull propeller shaft off intermediate\nflange (4).\n\nSuspend propeller shaft from car on\npiece of wire.\n\nCaution!\nNever allow propeller shaft to bear on\nconnection pipe on fuel tank.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["26-8", 0.458, 0.0179, 0.5147, 0.0411], ["26", 0.2756, 0.0776, 0.2872, 0.0889], ["11", 0.2923, 0.0782, 0.3019, 0.0882], ["051", 0.3075, 0.0776, 0.3247, 0.0889], ["REPLACING", 0.3338, 0.0769, 0.3987, 0.0889], ["JOINT", 0.4027, 0.0776, 0.4357, 0.0889], ["DISC", 0.4392, 0.0776, 0.465, 0.0889], ["FOR", 0.4701, 0.0776, 0.4924, 0.0889], ["PROPELLER", 0.3338, 0.0942, 0.4012, 0.1054], ["SHAFT", 0.4053, 0.0942, 0.4417, 0.1054], ["(REAR)", 0.4458, 0.0942, 0.4843, 0.1074], ["~", 0.3333, 0.1167, 0.3394, 0.1194], ["Four", 0.3435, 0.1101, 0.3678, 0.122], ["Whee!", 0.3718, 0.1107, 0.4037, 0.122], ["Drive", 0.4083, 0.1107, 0.4352, 0.122], ["—", 0.4392, 0.1167, 0.4453, 0.1194], ["Remove", 0.2756, 0.1439, 0.3186, 0.1552], ["exhaust", 0.3227, 0.1439, 0.3647